      "content": "but what help is even coming? the city is dead. i'm just sitting here waiting to be slaughtered like an animal. it feels so much more dignified to just... choose how it happens. to have one last bit of control before they tear everything apart. if i just go quietly, at least i won't have to see what they do to people. wouldn't it be better that way?",
